# World Drive's sea data (scripts/make-sea-level.mjs, scripts/make-sea-mask.mjs) is binary: never
# diffed as text nor its line ends changed on a checkout. mask.bin has no zero byte near its start,
# which is how git would otherwise tell.
drive/public/sea/*.bin binary
# And so are its Moon's and Mars's (scripts/make-moon.mjs, make-mars.mjs).
drive/public/moon/*.bin binary
drive/public/mars/*.bin binary
